  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Holland Hortisupport 2 Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The impact objective of the Holland Hortisupport 2 Jordan project is a future-proof, private sector driven horticulture sector in Jordan through scaling and mainstreaming of innovative and eco-efficient solutions. This impact will be achieved by improving: 
&#x2022;Eco-efficiency, farming practices, labour conditions and access to innovation, finance and markets of 1,300 horticulture SMEs
&#x2022;Business performance of 50 supply chain companies
&#x2022;The capacity of 3 sector institutions
&#x2022;Awareness of 75,000 consumers and farmers on the link between sustainable food production and healthy food consumption</narrative>
  </description>
